<title>AUSTRIA: Wienerberger 1996 EPS 104 ATS/share.</title>
<headline>Wienerberger 1996 EPS 104 ATS/share.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian brick maker Wienerberger Baustoffindustrie's 1996 per-share earnings fell to 104 schillings from 168 schillings a year earlier, the Association of Austrian Analysts said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Earlier, Wienerberger said final group pretax profit for the year had eased to 1.37 billion schillings from 1.495 billion. The group is due to release a final net profit figure later on Tuesday. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
